nexpected situation. What's in store for them?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/16o9waFpOavgPArZsKzYywnsyRZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-14\",\"runtime\":169},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"The Makeover Plan\",\"overview\":\"Kaushik demands money from Megha and Tani for the mental harrassment they caused, threatening to call the police. They soon find that they have a common enemy.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4qTDvdYiyYKBrvOMTBWMXHEubCs.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-14\",\"runtime\":169},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Diamond Heist\",\"overview\":\"Megha, Tani, and Lima hatch an elaborate plan with Kaushik to prepare for their diamond heist. Then, they reach Samar Poddar's jewellery store.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/woAXYtyz2wr06LAavr0f5xNzhcG.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-14\",\"runtime\":169},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"The Lion's Den\",\"overview\":\"Megha and Tani continue to work closely with Kaushik and keep an eye on Samar Poddar. Meanwhile, something is brewing among the three.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/akJnLgqD2ElPzc0Cx9dUdkFP3j7.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-14\",\"runtime\":169},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"The Final Cut\",\"overview\":\"Megha and Tani trick the influential businessmen and are joined by Kaushik and Lima. Will they be able to find the diamonds?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bEFunQSKQdaNZOYopuuFY1yf9Hp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-14\",\"runtime\":169}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2019-03-14\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}